<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 13.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 13.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Fontes Group forms a new training company called &quot;Tark Eesti&quot;.</p>
<p>- Companies that have not re-registered in the new companies' register will be closed down.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
